      "date": "2026-11-05",
      "headline": "Site rebuilt from the November 2026 prototype: 19 companies and 33 deals, with dates and sources researched.",
      "summary": [
        "Nvidia's \"up to $100B\" for OpenAI became $30B of equity plus a guarantee of up to $105B on OpenAI's leases.",
        "Anthropic ($965B) is now a second hub, with hundreds of billions in compute commitments to Google, Amazon, Broadcom, SpaceX, Microsoft and neoclouds.",
        "Amazon invested $50B in OpenAI, which committed $138B to AWS. xAI and Cursor now sit inside SpaceX.",
        "Every deal now has an announcement date and sources. Research corrected Oracle's Nvidia purchase to about $40B, and recorded that only $15B of Amazon's $50B for OpenAI was paid up front."
      ],
